WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
SENPAAAAAAI-

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.260
[CRASH]

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.860
[Car door opens]
Where's Senpai?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.260
*Gross demonic inhale*

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.580
HIIIIII!

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.860
*AGGRESSIVE SNIFF*

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.860
OOOkay, I'm gonna go on my way now.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.480
Bye Senpai! Have a lovely day at school!

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.040
[Distant yell] SENPAI!

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.920
The Cooking Club is the first way to win the hearts of all your friends.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.440
And they ARE your friends, no matter how much they scream they're not.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.560
I've got a plate of octopi *Laughs*

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.080
They're so cute!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.520
Look at you!

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.300
Look at all of you!

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.020
OH!

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.180
Senpai!

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.060
Don't you want my lovely sausages?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.120
Senpai!

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.180
It's gonna hurt my feelings-

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.680
[Crazed muttering] I might do something crazy-

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:52.380
[Normal tone] -if you don't take my food and put it inside you.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.060
Thank youuu~

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:57.680
[Distant yell] SENPAI!

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:58.900
Who're you?

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.400
What the hell?

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.580
Alright, you know what?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.520
Girl: Who do you think you are?

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.520
'Who do you think you are', BITCH?

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:07.760
I'll smack down with you guys with your stupid wooden sticks!

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.600
WOWOWOWOWOW

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.240
Girl: Don't even think about it! SHOWOWOWOWOWOWOWU

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.940
WOWUWOWIWOWUWIWO

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.700
SHOWOWOWOMWOWOMWUW-

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.200
[THUNK]

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:15.800
[SMACK]

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.220
OW! Why'd you do that?

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:19.980
Why did you do that?

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:25.320
I was trying to do something epic right there, why did you do that?

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:25.940
[Distant yell] SENPAI!

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:29.240
This means I can win a fight with those douchebags outside the school!

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:33.180
I'm gonna show them what for for not accepting my spicy sausage!

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:34.940
*Sigh*

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.480
Not eating the hot dogs.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.280
That's what I wanted to say.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.420
Oh!

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.120
[Magical whooshing sound]

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:45.080
OHH MY GOD! NO!

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.420
AUUH HO!

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.840
Ghastly voice: You wish to borrow my power?

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.980
Yeah sure, give it to me. *Squeaking*

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.540
Ghastly voice: *Chuckling*

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.180
*Not-so-evil laughter*

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.240
I'm going off to the other world!

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:58.620
Imma kill people!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.740
For FUN!

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.520
Oh my god!

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.060
Oh, this is amazing!

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.480
[Soft screaming]
Hi! Bye!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.680
[More screams]
Hi! Bye! Ohhh!

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:14.400
*Not-quite-sane laughter*

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:16.440
FUC-

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:17.960
Eugh, oh god!

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.960
Hey, look at me! It's a puppet show!

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.220
HahaHAhaha!

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.500
Okay. YOU'RE GONNA LOVE ME!

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.220
Repeat after me!

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.780
I love Senpai, yes I do! He's for me, not for you!

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:47.240
I love Senpai, yes I do! He's for me, not for you!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.280
I LOVE SENPAI, YES I DO! HE'S FOR ME, NOT FOR YOU!
